      "contentHtml": "\n\n                            <div class=\"content--wrapper\">\n\n                                \n\n                                <div class=\"content--top\">\n                                   \n                                  \n  <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n    <p data-end=\"44\" data-start=\"25\">Spoštovani potniki,</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"239\" data-start=\"46\">obveščamo vas, da bo od četrtka, 25. 6. 2026, do zaključka gradbenih del zaradi popolne prometne zapore Tbilisijske ulice linija 16 vozila po spremenjeni trasi.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"386\" data-start=\"241\">V času zapore bo linija 16 preusmerjena na obvozno traso:</p>\n\n<ul><li data-end=\"386\" data-start=\"241\">Tržaška cesta – Jadranska ulica – Cesta v Mestni log in nat<span style=\"font-size: 13.008px;\">o naprej po redni trasi.</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size: 13.008px;\">​</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamBusylj/LPPDetoursFetch/main/slike/63a50ae35440ac528c715433bdd8bf08.png\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"415\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"388\">Prosimo vas za razumevanje.</p>\n  </div>\n    \n                                    \n                                </div>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"content--bottom\">\n                                \n                                \n                                </div>\n\n                               \n                                \n                                <div id=\"content__share\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                </div>\n\n                            </div>\n\n                        "
